{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24700","headline":"自咏老身示诸家属 · 白居易","name":"自咏老身示诸家属","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寿及七十五，俸沾五十千。\n夫妻偕老日，甥侄聚居年。\n粥美尝新米，袍温换故绵。\n家居虽濩落，眷属幸团圆。\n置榻素屏下，移炉青帐前。\n书听孙子读，汤看侍儿煎。\n走笔还诗债，抽衣当药钱。\n支分闲事了，爬背向阳眠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24700.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24700","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}